# Dire (team 1) top-right; the y axis points down the screen, so Dota north is small y. Do not edit by hand; edit the script.
# Walkable: GridNav-open cells minus 2303 tree cells (trees are static here). Height levels: 0 river/low, 1 field, 2 base high ground, 3-4 cliffs and rims.
